---
import CalculatorLayout from '../../layouts/CalculatorLayout.astro';
---

<CalculatorLayout
  title="Mortgage Loan Calculator – Estimate Your Monthly Payment"
  description="Estimate your monthly mortgage payment, total interest, and loan repayment schedule based on your home price, down payment, interest rate, and loan term."
  category="Finance"
  calculatorName="Mortgage Loan Calculator"
  slug="mortgage-calculator"
  keywords={[
    'mortgage loan calculator',
    'mortgage calculator',
    'monthly mortgage calculator',
    'home loan calculator',
    'mortgage payment calculator',
    'mortgage amortization calculator',
    'mortgage calculator with extra payments',
    'house loan calculator',
    'principal and interest calculator'
  ]}
>
  <div class="space-y-6">

    <!-- QUICK PRESETS BAR -->
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/90 bg-white p-3.5 shadow-2xs dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 text-xs">
        <span class="font-bold text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mr-1 flex items-center gap-1">
          <span>⚡</span> Quick Presets:
        </span>
        <button type="button" class="btn-mg-preset rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-blue-500 hover:text-blue-600 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 cursor-pointer" data-price="5000000" data-down="1000000" data-rate="8.5" data-term="20" data-extra="0">🏡 Standard 20-Yr (₹50L @ 8.5%, 20% Down)</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn-mg-preset rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-blue-500 hover:text-blue-600 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 cursor-pointer" data-price="7500000" data-down="1125000" data-rate="8.25" data-term="30" data-extra="0">🏛️ 30-Yr Long Term (₹75L @ 8.25%, 15% Down)</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn-mg-preset rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-blue-500 hover:text-blue-600 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 cursor-pointer" data-price="4000000" data-down="1000000" data-rate="8.0" data-term="15" data-extra="0">⚡ 15-Yr Accelerated (₹40L @ 8.0%, 25% Down)</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn-mg-preset rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-blue-500 hover:text-blue-600 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 cursor-pointer" data-price="5000000" data-down="1000000" data-rate="8.5" data-term="20" data-extra="5000">💰 Prepayment (₹50L + ₹5k/mo Extra)</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- MAIN CALCULATOR FORM CONTAINER -->
    <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-slate-200/90 bg-linear-to-br from-white via-slate-50 to-blue-50/30 p-5 shadow-xl shadow-slate-900/5 dark:border-slate-800 dark:from-slate-950 dark:via-slate-950 dark:to-blue-950/20 sm:p-7">
      
      <div class="border-b border-slate-200/80 pb-3 dark:border-slate-800">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>🏡</span> Mortgage Loan Calculator
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
          Estimate your monthly mortgage payment, total interest, and loan repayment schedule based on your home price, down payment, interest rate, and loan term.
        </p>
      </div>

      <form id="form-mg" class="mt-4 space-y-4" novalidate onsubmit="return false;">
        
        <!-- ROW 1: PRIMARY LOAN INPUTS -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-4">
          <!-- Home Price -->
          <div>
            <label for="inp-mg-price" class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">Home Purchase Price (₹)</label>
            <input type="number" id="inp-mg-price" value="5000000" step="50000" min="1" class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white p-2.5 text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-white" placeholder="50,00,000" />
          </div>

          <!-- Down Payment (Amount & Sync %) -->
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <label for="inp-mg-down" class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">Down Payment (₹)</label>
              <span id="lbl-mg-down-pct" class="text-[11px] font-bold text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400">20%</span>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-1.5 flex rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800">
              <input type="number" id="inp-mg-down" value="1000000" step="25000" min="0" class="w-full rounded-l-xl border-0 p-2.5 text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 focus:ring-0 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-white" placeholder="10,00,000" />
              <input type="number" id="inp-mg-down-pct-input" value="20" min="0" max="100" step="1" class="w-16 rounded-r-xl border-l border-slate-300 bg-slate-50 p-2 text-center text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-900 dark:text-slate-300" title="Down payment percentage" />
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Annual Interest Rate -->
          <div>
            <label for="inp-mg-rate" class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">Interest Rate (% p.a.)</label>
            <input type="number" id="inp-mg-rate" value="8.5" step="0.1" min="0" max="30" class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white p-2.5 text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-white" placeholder="8.5" />
          </div>

          <!-- Loan Term & Unit -->
          <div>
            <label for="inp-mg-term" class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">Loan Term</label>
            <div class="mt-1.5 flex rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800">
              <input type="number" id="inp-mg-term" value="20" step="1" min="1" max="40" class="w-full rounded-l-xl border-0 p-2.5 text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 focus:ring-0 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-white" placeholder="20" />
              <select id="sel-mg-term-unit" class="rounded-r-xl border-l border-slate-300 bg-slate-50 px-2.5 text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-900 dark:text-slate-300 cursor-pointer">
                <option value="years" selected>Years</option>
                <option value="months">Months</option>
              </select>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- DERIVED LOAN AMOUNT BANNER & QUICK TERM BUTTONS -->
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 rounded-2xl border border-blue-200 bg-blue-50/40 p-3 dark:border-blue-900/60 dark:bg-blue-950/20 text-xs">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 font-bold text-blue-800 dark:text-blue-300">
            <span>💳</span> Calculated Loan Principal: <span id="txt-mg-loan-amt" class="font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white ml-1">₹ 40,00,000 (80% Financed)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-1">
            <span class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 font-semibold mr-1">Quick Terms:</span>
            <button type="button" class="btn-mg-quick-term rounded-md border border-slate-300 bg-white px-2 py-0.5 font-bold text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-slate-300 cursor-pointer" data-years="10">10Y</button>
            <button type="button" class="btn-mg-quick-term rounded-md border border-slate-300 bg-white px-2 py-0.5 font-bold text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-slate-300 cursor-pointer" data-years="15">15Y</button>
            <button type="button" class="btn-mg-quick-term active rounded-md bg-blue-600 px-2 py-0.5 font-bold text-white shadow-2xs cursor-pointer" data-years="20">20Y</button>
            <button type="button" class="btn-mg-quick-term rounded-md border border-slate-300 bg-white px-2 py-0.5 font-bold text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-slate-300 cursor-pointer" data-years="25">25Y</button>
            <button type="button" class="btn-mg-quick-term rounded-md border border-slate-300 bg-white px-2 py-0.5 font-bold text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-slate-300 cursor-pointer" data-years="30">30Y</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- ROW 2: OPTIONAL HOUSING COSTS (EXPANDABLE ACCORDION) -->
        <details class="group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900">
          <summary class="cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
            <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span>🏛️</span> Optional Additional Costs (Taxes, Insurance, HOA)
            </span>
            <span class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 font-semibold text-[11px] group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼ Expand</span>
          </summary>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-4 mt-3 pt-3 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800 text-xs">
            <div>
              <label for="inp-mg-tax" class="block font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">Annual Property Tax (₹)</label>
              <input type="number" id="inp-mg-tax" value="0" step="1000" min="0" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white p-2 font-bold dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-white" placeholder="0" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <label for="inp-mg-ins" class="block font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">Annual Home Insurance (₹)</label>
              <input type="number" id="inp-mg-ins" value="0" step="500" min="0" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white p-2 font-bold dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-white" placeholder="0" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <label for="inp-mg-pmi" class="block font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">Monthly PMI (₹)</label>
              <input type="number" id="inp-mg-pmi" value="0" step="200" min="0" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white p-2 font-bold dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-white" placeholder="0" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <label for="inp-mg-hoa" class="block font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">Monthly HOA / Maintenance (₹)</label>
              <input type="number" id="inp-mg-hoa" value="0" step="500" min="0" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white p-2 font-bold dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-white" placeholder="0" />
            </div>
          </div>
        </details>

        <!-- ROW 3: EXTRA MORTGAGE PAYMENTS (EXPANDABLE ACCORDION) -->
        <details class="group rounded-2xl border border-emerald-200 bg-emerald-50/20 p-4 dark:border-emerald-900/60 dark:bg-emerald-950/10">
          <summary class="cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-800 dark:text-emerald-300">
            <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span>🚀</span> Extra Mortgage Payments (Prepayment & Savings)
            </span>
            <span class="text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-[11px] group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼ Expand</span>
          </summary>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-3 mt-3 pt-3 border-t border-emerald-100 dark:border-emerald-900/40 text-xs">
            <div>
              <label for="inp-mg-extra-mo" class="block font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">Extra Monthly Payment (₹)</label>
              <input type="number" id="inp-mg-extra-mo" value="0" step="1000" min="0" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white p-2 font-bold dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-white" placeholder="0" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <label for="inp-mg-extra-yr" class="block font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">Extra Annual Payment (₹)</label>
              <input type="number" id="inp-mg-extra-yr" value="0" step="5000" min="0" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white p-2 font-bold dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-white" placeholder="0" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <label for="inp-mg-extra-once" class="block font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">One-Time Extra Payment (₹)</label>
              <input type="number" id="inp-mg-extra-once" value="0" step="10000" min="0" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white p-2 font-bold dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-white" placeholder="0" />
            </div>
          </div>
        </details>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 pt-2">
          <button type="submit" id="btn-calc-mg" class="flex-1 rounded-xl bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-extrabold text-white shadow-lg shadow-blue-600/25 transition active:scale-[0.98] cursor-pointer">
            Calculate Mortgage →
          </button>
          <button type="button" id="btn-clear-mg" class="rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 transition cursor-pointer">
            Clear All (✕)
          </button>
        </div>

        <p id="err-mg" class="hidden rounded-xl border border-red-200 bg-red-50 p-2.5 text-xs font-semibold text-red-700 dark:border-red-900/60 dark:bg-red-950/30 dark:text-red-300" role="alert" aria-live="polite"></p>

      </form>

      <!-- RESULTS PRESENTATION SECTION (Hidden Initially) -->
      <div id="mg-results-section" class="hidden mt-6 space-y-5">
        
        <!-- 1. Main Highlight Result Card -->
        <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-blue-200 bg-linear-to-br from-white via-blue-50/40 to-blue-100/50 p-5 shadow-lg shadow-blue-500/5 dark:border-blue-900/60 dark:from-slate-950 dark:via-slate-900 dark:to-blue-950/30 sm:p-7">
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between gap-4 border-b border-blue-200/80 pb-4 dark:border-slate-800">
            <div>
              <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-300">Estimated Total Monthly Payment</span>
              <div id="res-mg-total-mo" class="mt-1 text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400">₹ 34,713.06</div>
            </div>
            <div class="sm:text-right">
              <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Monthly Principal & Interest:</span>
              <div id="res-mg-pi-mo" class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white">₹ 34,713.06</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-4 grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-3 text-xs">
            <div class="rounded-xl border border-blue-200/60 bg-white/80 p-3 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900/70">
              <div class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 font-semibold">Loan Amount</div>
              <div id="res-mg-loan" class="mt-1 text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">₹ 40,00,000</div>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-xl border border-blue-200/60 bg-white/80 p-3 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900/70">
              <div class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 font-semibold">Total Interest Paid</div>
              <div id="res-mg-total-int" class="mt-1 text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-red-600 dark:text-red-400">₹ 43,31,135</div>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-xl border border-blue-200/60 bg-white/80 p-3 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900/70">
              <div class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 font-semibold">Total Amount Repaid</div>
              <div id="res-mg-total-repaid" class="mt-1 text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400">₹ 83,31,135</div>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-xl border border-blue-200/60 bg-white/80 p-3 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900/70">
              <div class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 font-semibold">Estimated Payoff Date</div>
              <div id="res-mg-payoff-date" class="mt-1 text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">Sep 2046</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 2. PRINCIPAL VS INTEREST RATIO CHART -->
        <div class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900 space-y-4">
          <h3 class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <span>📊</span> Loan Principal vs Total Interest Breakdown
          </h3>

          <div class="space-y-2">
            <div class="h-4 w-full overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-slate-100 flex dark:bg-slate-800">
              <div id="bar-mg-principal" class="bg-blue-600 transition-all duration-500" style="width: 48%;" title="Principal Borrowed"></div>
              <div id="bar-mg-interest" class="bg-red-500 transition-all duration-500" style="width: 52%;" title="Total Interest Charged"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
              <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
                <span class="inline-block h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-blue-600"></span>
                <span id="lbl-chart-principal">Principal Borrowed: ₹40,00,000 (48.0%)</span>
              </span>
              <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
                <span class="inline-block h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-red-500"></span>
                <span id="lbl-chart-interest">Total Interest: ₹43,31,135 (52.0%)</span>
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 3. EXTRA PAYMENT SAVINGS COMPARISON (When Active) -->
        <div id="card-mg-extra-comparison" class="hidden overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-emerald-200 bg-white p-5 dark:border-emerald-900/60 dark:bg-slate-900 shadow-md">
          <h3 class="text-sm font-black text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-300 flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-slate-200 pb-2.5 dark:border-slate-800">
            <span>🚀</span> Prepayment Impact & Interest Savings
          </h3>
          <div class="mt-3 grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-3 text-xs">
            <div class="rounded-xl border border-emerald-200 bg-emerald-50/50 p-3 dark:border-emerald-900/40 dark:bg-emerald-950/20">
              <div class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Estimated Interest Saved</div>
              <div id="res-mg-int-saved" class="mt-1 text-base font-black text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">₹ 8,42,150</div>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-xl border border-emerald-200 bg-emerald-50/50 p-3 dark:border-emerald-900/40 dark:bg-emerald-950/20">
              <div class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Repayment Time Saved</div>
              <div id="res-mg-time-saved" class="mt-1 text-base font-black text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400">4 Years 2 Months</div>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-3 dark:border-slate-800">
              <div class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">New Loan Duration</div>
              <div id="res-mg-new-duration" class="mt-1 text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">15.8 Years (190 Mos)</div>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-3 dark:border-slate-800">
              <div class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">New Total Interest</div>
              <div id="res-mg-new-int" class="mt-1 text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">₹ 34,88,985</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 4. AMORTIZATION SCHEDULE (YEARLY SUMMARY & MONTHLY SCHEDULE TABS) -->
        <div class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900">
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between gap-3 mb-4">
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 flex items-center gap-1.5">
                <span>📅</span> Mortgage Amortization Schedule
              </h3>
              <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
                View yearly summary or complete monthly principal and interest schedule.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
              <!-- View Switcher Tabs -->
              <div class="inline-flex rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-100 p-1 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 text-xs font-bold">
                <button type="button" id="tab-mg-yearly" class="active rounded-lg bg-white px-3 py-1 text-slate-900 shadow-xs dark:bg-slate-900 dark:text-white cursor-pointer">
                  Yearly Summary
                </button>
                <button type="button" id="tab-mg-monthly" class="rounded-lg px-3 py-1 text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-400 dark:hover:text-white cursor-pointer">
                  Monthly Schedule
                </button>
              </div>

              <!-- Download PDF Button -->
              <button type="button" id="btn-mg-download-pdf" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-xl bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 px-3.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold text-white shadow-xs transition active:scale-[0.98] cursor-pointer" title="Download active amortization schedule as PDF">
                <span>📄</span> <span id="txt-btn-mg-pdf">Download PDF</span>
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Schedule Table Container -->
          <div class="overflow-x-auto max-h-96 scrollbar-thin">
            <table class="w-full text-left text-xs">
              <thead id="mg-sched-thead" class="bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 font-bold sticky top-0">
                <!-- Injected dynamically -->
              </thead>
              <tbody id="mg-sched-tbody" class="divide-y divide-slate-100 dark:divide-slate-800 font-mono">
                <!-- Injected dynamically -->
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

  </div>

  <!-- EDUCATIONAL SEO ARTICLE SLOT (Styled matching age.astro) -->
  <Fragment slot="content">
    <section class="mortgage-content">
      <h2>How to Use This Mortgage Loan Calculator</h2>
      <p>
        Planning your home financing is easy with this comprehensive mortgage and amortization engine:
      </p>
      <ol>
        <li><strong>Enter the home price:</strong> Input the total purchase price of the property in Indian Rupees (₹).</li>
        <li><strong>Enter your down payment:</strong> Input your down payment amount or adjust the percentage (e.g. 20%).</li>
        <li><strong>Review the loan principal:</strong> The financed loan amount is automatically calculated (Home Price − Down Payment).</li>
        <li><strong>Enter the interest rate:</strong> Input your annual mortgage rate (e.g. 8.5% per annum).</li>
        <li><strong>Select the loan tenure:</strong> Choose your loan duration in <em>Years</em> or <em>Months</em>, or use the quick term buttons (10Y, 15Y, 20Y, 25Y, 30Y).</li>
        <li><strong>Add optional housing costs:</strong> Expand the additional costs section to include Property Tax, Home Insurance, PMI, or HOA/maintenance fees.</li>
        <li><strong>Add extra mortgage payments:</strong> Test prepayment strategies by entering extra monthly, annual, or one-time lump-sum payments.</li>
        <li><strong>Click Calculate Mortgage:</strong> View your estimated monthly payment (P&I and total escrow), total interest, and exact payoff date.</li>
        <li><strong>Explore amortization schedules:</strong> Toggle between the <em>Yearly Summary</em> and <em>Monthly Schedule</em>.</li>
        <li><strong>Download PDF:</strong> Export your active schedule as a professional PDF report with website branding.</li>
      </ol>

      <h2>Mortgage Payment Example</h2>
      <p>
        Consider a home purchase of <strong>₹50,00,000</strong> with a <strong>₹10,00,000 down payment (20%)</strong> and a <strong>₹40,00,000 loan</strong> at an interest rate of <strong>8.5%</strong> over <strong>20 years</strong>:
      </p>
      <div class="my-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900 text-xs sm:text-sm space-y-1.5 font-mono">
        <div>Home Purchase Price = ₹50,00,000</div>
        <div>Down Payment (20%) = ₹10,00,000 | Financed Loan Amount = ₹40,00,000</div>
        <div>Annual Interest Rate = 8.5% | Loan Term = 20 Years (240 Months)</div>
        <div>Monthly Interest Rate (r) = 8.5 / 12 / 100 = 0.0070833</div>
        <div>Monthly Principal & Interest Payment = <strong>₹34,713.06 / month</strong></div>
        <div class="text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 font-bold">Total Interest Paid over 20 Years = ₹43,31,134.84</div>
        <div class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 font-bold">Total Amount Repaid (Principal + Interest) = ₹83,31,134.84</div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 italic">
        * This example is for illustration. Actual mortgage or home loan payments may vary based on lender terms, fees, taxes, insurance, and other factors.
      </p>

      <h2>Principal vs Interest in a Mortgage</h2>
      <p>
        In a standard fixed-rate amortizing loan, each monthly payment is split between reducing the principal balance and paying accrued interest:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Early Years (Interest-Heavy):</strong> In the initial years, the outstanding loan principal is at its maximum, meaning a large fraction of your monthly payment goes toward interest charges.</li>
        <li><strong>Later Years (Principal-Heavy):</strong> As the principal balance steadily drops, monthly interest charges decrease, and a larger portion of each payment directly reduces the remaining loan balance.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How Extra Mortgage Payments Can Affect Your Loan</h2>
      <p>
        Making extra payments directly reduces your loan principal before interest is calculated for subsequent months:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Accelerated Payoff:</strong> Additional payments bypass interest charges and immediately lower the remaining loan balance.</li>
        <li><strong>Substantial Interest Savings:</strong> By reducing the principal early, you permanently eliminate interest compounding on that portion over the remaining loan term.</li>
        <li><strong>Shortened Loan Duration:</strong> Extra payments can shave years off your mortgage tenure without requiring a formal loan refinance.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Fixed vs Variable Mortgage Interest Rates</h2>
      <p>
        Understanding how rate structures impact long-term borrowing stability:
      </p>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto my-4">
        <table class="w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-sm border-collapse border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">
          <thead class="bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-900 dark:text-white font-bold">
            <tr>
              <th class="p-3 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">Factor</th>
              <th class="p-3 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">Fixed-Rate Mortgage</th>
              <th class="p-3 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">Variable / Floating-Rate Mortgage</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="divide-y divide-slate-200 dark:divide-slate-800 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 font-semibold border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">Interest Rate Stability</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">Remains constant across the entire tenure</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">Fluctuates with benchmark repo rates (e.g. RBI repo rate)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 font-semibold border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">Payment Predictability</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">Monthly P&I payment never changes</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">Monthly payment or loan tenure adjusts when benchmark changes</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 font-semibold border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">Initial Pricing</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">Often slightly higher initial interest rate</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">Usually offers lower initial interest rates</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 font-semibold border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">Prepayment Penalties</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">May have foreclosure or prepayment fees</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">Zero prepayment penalties on floating home loans for individuals in India</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <h2>Mortgage Calculator vs EMI Calculator</h2>
      <p>
        While both tools calculate loan repayments using standard amortization mathematics, a <strong>Mortgage Calculator</strong> provides home-specific escrow modeling including down payments, property taxes, home insurance, private mortgage insurance (PMI), HOA fees, and multi-tier prepayment schedules. A generic <strong>EMI Calculator</strong> focuses strictly on calculating the installment for personal, auto, or business loans.
      </p>

      <h2>Common Mistakes When Using a Mortgage Calculator</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Looking Only at Monthly Payment:</strong> Choosing a 30-year term over a 20-year term lowers your monthly payment but can nearly double your total interest paid.</li>
        <li><strong>Ignoring Escrow & Property Taxes:</strong> Forgetting property taxes, insurance, and maintenance fees that add 15% to 25% to your actual monthly housing bill.</li>
        <li><strong>Underestimating Down Payment Impact:</strong> A smaller down payment increases your loan amount and may trigger mandatory PMI charges.</li>
        <li><strong>Assuming Fixed Interest Rates on Floating Loans:</strong> In India, most retail home loans are floating rate; future rate hikes will extend tenure or increase monthly EMIs.</li>
        <li><strong>Overlooking Loan Processing Fees:</strong> Lenders charge processing fees, legal valuation costs, and stamp duty upfront.</li>
        <li><strong>Treating the Estimate as a Final Offer:</strong> Actual terms depend on your credit score (CIBIL/FICO), loan-to-value ratio, and lender underwriting criteria.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Important Assumptions and Information</h2>
      <p>
        Please review these key calculation principles:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Amortization Method:</strong> Standard monthly compounding amortization with interest applied on the opening balance of each monthly cycle.</li>
        <li><strong>Prepayment Processing:</strong> Extra payments are credited toward reducing outstanding principal immediately on the designated payment month.</li>
        <li><strong>Educational Estimates:</strong> This tool provides mathematical simulations and does not constitute certified mortgage lending, legal, or tax advice.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
